  11:../../libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****  * 
  12:../../libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****  *  Storage occupied by the struct will be one word larger than 
  13:../../libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****  *  the SettingStruct used. The extra word is used to store the
  14:../../libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****  *  state of the data, and whether it's been overwritten or not.
  15:../../libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****  * 
